  "notes": "Cash basis county, governmental funds only. Statement lines from Exhibit D Total Governmental column (p4). Fund balances (p4) recorded as fund balance; ending cash/investments from the governmental funds balance sheet p3 (pooled cash 9,757,028 and designated investments 1,696,175; totals equal the Statement of Net Position p1); beginning cash not printed. Identity reconciles on fund balance: 9,596,188 + 10,805,685 - 8,948,670 + 1,666,552 - 1,666,552 = 11,453,203. General Fund 'Taxes' 5,503,883 split using the General column of p4 (Property Taxes + Motor Vehicle Tax), as FY2023. 'Local' lines kept as printed (context label). American Rescue Plan is a major fund in FY2022 with its own budget schedule (p10). Nonmajor funds detail from the combining schedule (pp11-13) per fund; the Schedule 3 budget pages (pp14-16) print only per-fund totals, so they are not recorded to avoid double counting. Read pages 1-16 of 16"
}
